items.title:
@ALEXUS36 regulatory decision date being pushed from June 26 to July 1 for Google ($GOOG/$GOOGL) and Klarna, the market is usually interpreting that in one of three ways:

1. Administrative delay, not necessarily bad news
    * Regulators sometimes move announcement dates because they need more time

